- The PLL\_OUT\_DIV value must be even.
- PLL\_OUT frequencies are at 22.5792 or 24.576 MHz. CLKOUT frequencies can be obtained by configuring the CLK\_OUT\_DIV value:

| PLL\_OUT    | CLK\_OUT\_DIV (2) | CLK\_OUT\_DIV (3) | CLK\_OUT\_DIV (4) | CLK\_OUT\_DIV (8) |
| :---------- | :---------------- | :---------------- | :---------------- | :---------------- |
| 22.5792 MHz | 11.2896 MHz       | 7.5264 MHz        | 5.6448 MHz        | 2.8224 MHz        |
