| <br /> | <br />                        | 0x18000E                           | 0x05                      | <br />                                                                    |
| <br /> | <br />                        | 0x18001D                           | 0x31                      | <br />                                                                    |
| <br /> | <br />                        | 0x18001E                           | 0x04                      | <br />                                                                    |
| <br /> | <br />                        | 0x18002D                           | 0x30                      | <br />                                                                    |
| <br /> | <br />                        | 0x18002E                           | 0x01                      | <br />                                                                    |
| <br /> | <br />                        | 0x18003D                           | 0x9C                      | <br />                                                                    |
| <br /> | <br />                        | 0x18003E                           | 0x03                      | <br />                                                                    |
| 2      | Disable channel B invert      | PCM Path Signal Control 2. 0x90004 | data (0x90004) AND (0xFB) | Reserved 0000PCM\_INV\_A xPCM\_INV\_B 0PCM\_SWAP\_CHAN xPCM\_COPY\_CHAN x |

