| 24     | Configure HP                                                                                              | <br />                                                                                                         | <br />        | <br />                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
| 25     | Configure Class H Amplifier                                                                               | Class H Control. 0x80000                                                                                       | 0x1E          | Reserved 000ADPT\_PWR 111HV\_EN 1EXT\_VCPFILT 0                                                                                                                                                                |
| 26     | Set HP output to full scale                                                                               | HP Output Control 1. 0x80000                                                                                   | 0x30          | HP\_CLAMPA 0HP\_CLAMPB 0OUT\_FS 11HP\_IN\_EN 0HP\_IN\_LP 0Reserved 0+1dB\_EN 0                                                                                                                                 |
| 27     | Configure Headphone Detect                                                                                | HP Detect. 0xD0000                                                                                             | 0x04          | HPDETECT\_CTRL 00HPDETECT\_INV 0HPDETECT\_RISE\_DBC\_TIME 0HPDETECT\_FALL\_DBC\_TIME 10Reserved 0                                                                                                              |
| 28     | Headphone Detect                                                                                          | HP Detect. 0xD0000                                                                                             | 0xC4          | HPDETECT\_CTRL 11HPDETECT\_INV 0HPDETECT\_RISE\_DBC\_TIME 0HPDETECT\_FALL\_DBC\_TIME 10Reserved 0                                                                                                              |
| 29     | Enable Interrupts                                                                                         | <br />                                                                                                         | <br />        | <br />                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
| 30     | Read Interrupt Status 1 register (0xF0000) and Interrupt Status 5 register (0xF0004) to clear sticky bits | <br />                                                                                                         | <br />        | <br />                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
| 31     | Enable Headphone Detect Interrupts                                                                        | Interrupt Mask 1. 0xF0010                                                                                      | 0x81          | DAC\_OVFL\_INT\_MASK 1HPDETECT\_PLUG\_INT\_MASK 0HPDETECT\_UNPLUG\_INT\_MASK 0XTAL\_READY\_INT\_MASK 0XTAL\_ERROR\_INT\_MASK 0PLL\_READY\_INT\_MASK 0PLL\_ERROR\_INT\_MASK 0PDN\_DONE\_INT\_MASK 1             |
| 32     | Enable DSD Interrupts                                                                                     | Interrupt Mask 5. 0xF0014                                                                                      | 0x03          | DSD\_STUCK\_INT\_MASK 0DSD\_INVAL\_A\_INT\_MASK 0DSD\_INVAL\_B\_INT\_MASK 0DSD\_SILENCE\_A\_INT\_MASK 0DSD\_SILENCE\_B\_INT\_MASK 0DSD\_RATE\_ERROR\_INT\_MASK 0DOP\_MRK\_DET\_INT\_MASK 1DOP\_ON\_INT\_MASK 1 |
| 33     | Wait for interrupt. Check if PLL\_READY\_INT = 1 in Interrupt Status 1 register (0xF0000)                 | <br />                                                                                                         | <br />        | <br />                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
