In Ex. 5-9, an external 19.2-MHz MCLK is used with a PLL to generate an internal MCLK or 22.5792 MHz, and the ASP is in clock master receiving DoP data with LRCLK at 176.4 kHz and SCLK at 8.4672 MHz.

