#### 5.13.7 Analog-In Startup

Ex. 5-13 shows an example sequence of starting up the CS43131 in analog passthrough mode.

Example 5-13. Start Up to Analog-In

| STEP | TASK                                                   | REGISTER/BIT FIELDS                                                     | VALUE  | DESCRIPTION |
| :--- | :----------------------------------------------------- | :---------------------------------------------------------------------- | :----- | :---------- |
| 1    | Apply all relevant power supplies, then assert RESET.  | <br />                                                                  | <br /> | <br />      |
| 2    | Wait for 1.5 ms. MCLK Source is set to RCO by default. | <br />                                                                  | <br /> | <br />      |
| 3    | Enable Headphone detect.                               | Refer to Section 5.13.11 "Headphone Detection"                          | <br /> | <br />      |
| 4    | Enable HPINx path.                                     | Refer to Section 5.5.1 "HPINx Alternate Headphone Path Enable Sequence" | <br /> | <br />      |

