| <br />  | <br /> | DEVIDA | <br /> | <br /> | <br /> | DEVIDB | <br /> | <br /> |
| Default | 0      | 1      | 0      | 0      | 0      | 0      | 1      | 1      |

| Bits | Name   | Description                 |
| :--- | :----- | :-------------------------- |
| 7:4  | DEVIDA | Part number first digit: 4  |
| 3:0  | DEVIDB | Part number second digit: 3 |

